# skills: a boss cannot be put to sleep, and the pick is refused up front. Jian at level 25 (level index 24
# pinned, battle MP pinned to 50) in the Sasquatch fight (event battle 1, forced from Delrich Temple as
# boss_sasquatch.plan does): Sasquatch (enemy row 136, a boss row: row flags bit 31) is battler 9 between two
# Yetis (battlers 8 and 10). Special, Knockout Kick, and the grid opens on the left Yeti; Right moves to
# Sasquatch and A is refused with "No effect!" (shot kb_refused), no MP taken; Right moves to the other Yeti
# and A casts on it (MP 50 -> 41; with the random state set to 24 the roll succeeds and battler 10's status
# goes 0 -> 1). Battle records at 0x0228E860 (0x6C each; status in the low nibble of +0x08). Run with --save.
include boot_from_save
include cheats_strong
pin u16 0x020B77EC 6
press Right 40
press Down,Right 40
press Right 40
press Down 80
wait 200
unpin
include cheats_strong
pin u32 0x020B4664 24
pinptr u32 0x020B8620 0x18 50
execpoke 0x020503A0 u32 0x020A0238 24
wait 30
poke u16 0x020B7838 1
poke u16 0x020B783A 1
poke u32 0x020B0010 0x73
waituntil u32 0x020B0010 7 3000
wait 120
battlers
peek u32 0x020B8620 records
watch u32 0x0228E878 jian_mp
watch u8 0x0228EBC8 status8
watch u8 0x0228EC34 status9
watch u8 0x0228ECA0 status10
press A 8
wait 50
press Right 8
wait 50
press A 8
wait 50
press Right 8
wait 50
press Down 8
wait 50
press A 8
wait 60
shot kb_grid
press Right 8
wait 30
shot kb_boss
press A 8
wait 20
shot kb_refused
wait 80
press Right 8
wait 30
shot kb_yeti
press A 8
wait 200
shot kb_cast
wait 200
shot kb_after
